  "factor_name": "RSI(14) mean-reversion",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "100 - 100/(1 + EWM(|up|,14)/EWM(|down|,14))",
    "description": "Wilder-style RSI-14 on daily closes. High RSI (overbought) assets are expected to underperform over ~2-week horizon, low RSI to outperform (cross-asset mean reversion). Admission at h=10: positive IC = low RSI wins, i.e. direction=-1 on raw RSI."
